# BaseFlood SEO Cleanup - Redirect Rules
# Deploy: git push → auto-deployed to Cloudflare Pages
# Test: curl -I https://baseflood.com/?ND (should get 301)

# 1. www → non-www (highest priority)
https://www.baseflood.com/* https://baseflood.com/:splat 301!

# 2. Strip query parameters (all pages)
https://baseflood.com/?* https://baseflood.com/ 301!
https://baseflood.com/about?* https://baseflood.com/about 301!
https://baseflood.com/contact?* https://baseflood.com/contact 301!
https://baseflood.com/services?* https://baseflood.com/services 301!
https://baseflood.com/training?* https://baseflood.com/training 301!
https://baseflood.com/resources?* https://baseflood.com/resources 301!
https://baseflood.com/faq?* https://baseflood.com/faq 301!
https://baseflood.com/working-with-us?* https://baseflood.com/working-with-us 301!
https://baseflood.com/privacy?* https://baseflood.com/privacy 301!

# 3. Legacy WordPress paths → homepage
/sample-page/ /index.html 301!
/sample-page /index.html 301!
/hello-world/ /index.html 301!
/hello-world /index.html 301!
/pastordave/ /index.html 301!
/pastordave /index.html 301!
/pastordave-text/ /index.html 301!
/pastordave-text /index.html 301!

# 4. WordPress system paths → homepage
/wp-content/* /index.html 301!
/wp-admin/* /index.html 301!
/wp-login* /index.html 301!

# 5. Legacy /cover-page/* restructured pages
/cover-page/about/ /about 301!
/cover-page/about /about 301!
/cover-page/contact/ /contact 301!
/cover-page/contact /contact 301!
/cover-page/* /index.html 301!
